{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>I HAD A PLAN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Wizard. A brilliant Wizard, with a brilliant plan. Unfortunately you also have team mates. As you make your way through dungeons and enchanted forests alike, you need to manage your team mates\u2026 and your frustration. I Had A Plan! is a Tactical Roguelite Semi-Autobattler, which takes place in a 3D world with Hex Grids, using 2D Characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/UI.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIVE COMMANDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t fight with your Wizard directly, instead you can give your team orders, which they might follow. If they do listen, they follow your orders and get a small bonus to that action. If they do not however, your frustration grows. Your frustration meter is vital, once it fills up, there is only one answer: Fireball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/Tutorials.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WATCH THEM FIGHT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't feel like telling them what to do? Maybe they're smart enough to win by themselves! Or maybe they're not, and they'll burn, it's a win-win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/FireStorm.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AND MUCH MORE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find new Characters to Recruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Equip your team with insane weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use magical Charms to shape your run and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choose your path through mysterious Realms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discoveries, Realm Quests and Metaprogression will keep you coming back!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Accused","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/c5bc130230d3c5ec5bf3df200e8986e5813d966e.jpg"},{"name":"The Brown Nose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/04da9ed6a48d385582913dc558153d40065ad47a.jpg"},{"name":"The Charmer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/7b45821efc1b3c821ac871e06eb9742bd3b09552.jpg"},{"name":"The Doubter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/812108cddeda20a06f5bda7311c29e743434b0aa.jpg"},{"name":"The Glass Cannon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/5d3b655705920c75d4656bcaddb1ca47d95baf04.jpg"},{"name":"The Hairy Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/2e24cea2ac74ba63d2bf39f273881a0eb058e2a4.jpg"},{"name":"The Hoarder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/5e6701e37b270dcafde4e1014f311dc63bba55ed.jpg"},{"name":"The Immaculate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/2ae4848510f9ad8786909a729d3a9806b03d2ea6.jpg"},{"name":"The Iron Man","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/2fc219743b2c4291ece81c3105bb0faa4f3e95a4.jpg"},{"name":"The Micromanager","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2375280/687372415fa6ff8f0d93835ed40b2061ba73337e.jpg"}],"total":49},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2375280?t=1743406235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2375280?t=1743406235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743406235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743406235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"I Had A Plan features combat between Allies and Enemies, with some blood and other special effects."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2557540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>I HAD A PLAN!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Wizard. A brilliant Wizard, with a brilliant plan. Unfortunately you also have team mates. As you make your way through dungeons and enchanted forests alike, you need to manage your team mates\u2026 and your frustration. I Had A Plan! is a Tactical Roguelite Semi-Autobattler, which takes place in a 3D world with Hex Grids, using 2D Characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/UI.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GIVE COMMANDS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t fight with your Wizard directly, instead you can give your team orders, which they might follow. If they do listen, they follow your orders and get a small bonus to that action. If they do not however, your frustration grows. Your frustration meter is vital, once it fills up, there is only one answer: Fireball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/Tutorials.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WATCH THEM FIGHT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't feel like telling them what to do? Maybe they're smart enough to win by themselves! Or maybe they're not, and they'll burn, it's a win-win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/extras/FireStorm.png?t=1743406235\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AND MUCH MORE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Find new Characters to Recruit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Equip your team with insane weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use magical Charms to shape your run and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Choose your path through mysterious Realms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Discoveries, Realm Quests and Metaprogression will keep you coming back!</p>","developers":["Benevolent Banana Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2375280/header.jpg?t=1743406235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116460,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116460/movie480.mp4?t=1742412022","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116460/movie_max.mp4?t=1742412022"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116460/55b644e28bf76740bfa18d7300b06a9373ab31d6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742412022","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116460/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742412022","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116460/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742412022"}}],"name":"I Had a Plan!","package_groups":[{"descript